{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'm Maj. Alvarez, your S-6. Before we finalize the communications annex this morning, I want to confirm a couple of things during our huddle. We have two portable relay kits available — Kit A and Kit B. I understand both the northern liaison site and the southern command post need a relay kit from 0800 through 1600 today. Can someone confirm those are the only two sites requiring a relay kit, and that there are no other maintenance issues or equipment concerns I should know about before I assign the kits and sign the annex?"}
```

