{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Sir, I need to flag a maintenance issue with Kit B before we assign it. I verified the battery log this morning — Kit B's installed battery pack is only certified for four hours, from 0800 through 1200. We have a replacement pack staged at the commo shop, but it requires a 15-minute swap at 1200. That maintenance entry hasn't been posted to the equipment status board yet, so nobody else has seen it. Given that Capt. Brooks just indicated Kit B needs to go to the northern liaison site for the full 0800 through 1600 window, we need to account for that battery swap at 1200 — either by scheduling the swap on-site or adjusting the plan."}
```

